# Title: Exports Registry Key To a File
# ID: f0e53e89-8d22-46ea-9db5-9d4796ee2f8a
# Status: test
# Level: low
# Author: Oddvar Moe, Sander Wiebing, oscd.community
# Date: 2020-10-07
# Tags: attack.exfiltration, attack.discovery, attack.t1012
# Description: Detects the export of the target Registry key to a file.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((process.command_line:* -E *) AND ((process.executable:*\\regedit.exe) OR (process.pe.original_file_name:"REGEDIT.EXE"))) AND NOT ((((process.command_line:*hklm* OR process.command_line:*hkey_local_machine*)) AND ((process.command_line:*\\system OR process.command_line:*\\sam OR process.command_line:*\\security)))))
